<main class="gg-page">
  <section class="gg-hero">
    <div class="gg-hero-copy">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Built by three college students</p>
      <h1>A garden for the goals you are still trying to grow.</h1>
      <p>
        Goal Grower turns habits and long-term goals into plants you care for.
        Water them with small actions, grow shared gardens, and keep coming back.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-actions">
        <a href="/pages/contact#testing" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Join beta testing</a>
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn gg-btn-light">Fund the project</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-phone-scene">
      <div class="gg-paper-note note-one">built from small progress</div>
      <div class="gg-paper-note note-two">made by real students</div>

      <div class="gg-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          <p class="gg-phone-topline">Today’s garden</p>
          <div class="gg-plant"></div>
          <h3>Morning stretch</h3>
          <p>One small action keeps this plant alive.</p>
          <button>Water plant</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="story" class="gg-sohub-stack">
    <article class="gg-sohub-card gg-card-dark">
      <div>
        <p class="gg-eyebrow">Why it exists</p>
        <h2>Goals should feel <span>alive</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        Most goal apps feel like another task list. Goal Grower turns progress
        into something you can see, care for, and return to.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="gg-sohub-card gg-card-charcoal">
      <div>
        <p class="gg-eyebrow">The problem</p>
        <h2>Life gets <span>busy</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        School, work, stress, missed days, and unfinished plans can make it easy
        to stop trying.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="gg-sohub-card gg-card-green">
      <div>
        <p class="gg-eyebrow">The loop</p>
        <h2>Plant. Water. <span>Return.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        You do not need a perfect streak. You just need to keep coming back
        before the plant fades.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="gg-sohub-card gg-card-paper">
      <div>
        <p class="gg-eyebrow">The mission</p>
        <h2>Grow with <span>others</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        Shared gardens help friends, families, classmates, and teams stay
        accountable without making goals feel lonely.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-loop-section">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2>A small loop for real life.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-loop-grid">
      <div class="gg-loop-card"><span>01</span><h3>Plant</h3><p>Create a habit or long-term goal.</p></div>
      <div class="gg-loop-card"><span>02</span><h3>Water</h3><p>Complete one small action.</p></div>
      <div class="gg-loop-card"><span>03</span><h3>Grow</h3><p>Watch your plant change over time.</p></div>
      <div class="gg-loop-card"><span>04</span><h3>Share</h3><p>Build shared gardens with others.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-testing">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Beta testing</p>
      <h2>Help us test Goal Grower before launch.</h2>
      <p>
        Leave your email to get testing links, early access, and build updates.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-email-card">
      {% form 'customer', class: 'gg-email-form' %}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="Goal Grower Beta Tester">

        <label for="GoalGrowerEmail">Email for beta testing</label>

        <div class="gg-email-row">
          <input
            id="GoalGrowerEmail"
            type="email"
            name="contact[email]"
            placeholder="you@example.com"
            required
          >
          <button type="submit">Join list</button>
        </div>

        {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
          <p class="gg-form-success">Thank you. You are on the testing list.</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if form.errors %}
          <p class="gg-form-error">Please check your email and try again.</p>
        {% endif %}
      {% endform %}

      <p class="gg-email-note">No spam. Just testing and launch updates.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-about-band">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">About us</p>
      <h2>Three college students building something useful.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is being designed, tested, and improved by a small student
        team learning how to build a real app and business.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/about-goal-grower" class="gg-btn gg-btn-light">Meet the team</a>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-fund">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Fund the project</p>
      <h2>Support the next version.</h2>
      <p>
        Support helps cover testing, app store costs, design, development, and
        the tools needed to keep Goal Grower moving.
      </p>
      <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn gg-btn-light">Support development</a>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-fund-card">
      <h3>Support helps with</h3>
      <div><span>01</span><p>Testing and publishing costs</p></div>
      <div><span>02</span><p>Shared gardens and reminders</p></div>
      <div><span>03</span><p>Better onboarding and tutorials</p></div>
      <div><span>04</span><p>Keeping a student-built project alive</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-store">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Store</p>
      <h2>Merch and tools that help fund the app.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower merch, journals, desk tools, tech accessories, and small
        products can support the app’s development.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-store-grid">
      <a href="/collections/goal-grower" class="gg-product-card">
        <div class="gg-product-image"></div>
        <span>Merch</span>
        <h3>Goal Grower apparel</h3>
        <p>Simple merch connected to the app.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/stationery" class="gg-product-card">
        <div class="gg-product-image"></div>
        <span>Desk</span>
        <h3>Journals and planners</h3>
        <p>Offline tools for goals and ideas.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/tech" class="gg-product-card">
        <div class="gg-product-image"></div>
        <span>Tech</span>
        <h3>Focus accessories</h3>
        <p>Small products for calmer routines.</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-center-action">
      <a href="/pages/goal-grower-store" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Visit store page</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-contact-band">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Feedback</p>
      <h2>Tell us what would make this better.</h2>
      <p>
        Send feature ideas, bugs, testing questions, store questions, or general feedback.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Contact us</a>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-final">
    <h2>Start with one small seed.</h2>
    <p>Join the testing list and help shape Goal Grower before launch.</p>
    <a href="/pages/contact#testing" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Join beta testing</a>
  </section>
</main>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Home",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Goal Grower Home"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}